<title>USA: N.E. Johnson Cty SFD 2, Kan., won by Country Club.</title>
<headline>N.E. Johnson Cty SFD 2, Kan., won by Country Club.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Country Club Bank said it won $2.500 million of Northeast Johnson Cty, CFD 2, Kan., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.080  percent.</p>
</text>
